## How to remove what the agent installed

```bash
# Remove cargo-installed binaries
cargo uninstall cargo-xwin
cargo uninstall cargo-wix

# Remove the Windows cross-compile target
rustup target remove x86_64-pc-windows-msvc

# Remove project-local Node dependencies
cd /Users/eren/Projects/TUWEL-Auto-2FA
rm -rf node_modules pnpm-lock.yaml

# Remove Rust build artifacts
cd native-host
rm -rf target
```
